lo0 try

Plan
  Harness       Claude Code on a local model
  Model         Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B · Q4_K_M · 64k window
  Background    Qwen3.5-2B · Q8_0 · 64k window
  Runtime       Ollama · http://127.0.0.1:11434
  Served as     lo0/qwen3-coder-30b-a3b:64k
                lo0/qwen3.5-2b:64k

Steps
  ✓  Download Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B at Q4_K_M
  1  Create lo0/qwen3-coder-30b-a3b:64k with a 64k context window
     num_ctx 65,536
  2  Download Qwen3.5-2B at Q8_0                                         2.3 GiB
     ollama pull hf.co/unsloth/Qwen3.5-2B-GGUF:Q8_0
  3  Create lo0/qwen3.5-2b:64k with a 64k context window
     num_ctx 65,536
  4  Check that Ollama answers as lo0/qwen3-coder-30b-a3b:64k
     POST http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1/messages

Session
  Start claude once the steps are done
    ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434
    ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=ollama
    ANTHROPIC_MODEL=lo0/qwen3-coder-30b-a3b:64k
    ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL=lo0/qwen3-coder-30b-a3b:64k
    ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL=lo0/qwen3-coder-30b-a3b:64k
    ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_FABLE_MODEL=lo0/qwen3-coder-30b-a3b:64k
    ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL=lo0/qwen3.5-2b:64k
    CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_CONTEXT_TOKENS=65536
    CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS=16384
    CLAUDE_CODE_ATTRIBUTION_HEADER=0
    CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_NONESSENTIAL_TRAFFIC=1
    ANTHROPIC_API_KEY unset
    Set for this session only; your Claude Code settings are not changed.

Then
